cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use scratchDraCor, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "scratchDraCor"
abstract: >-
  scratchDraCor is a TurboWarp custom extension that brings the DraCor API
  (https://dracor.org/api/v1) to Scratch-style blocks. It provides blocks for
  corpora, plays, characters, spoken text and network metrics, and resolves
  DraCor play IDs.
authors:
  - family-names: "Börner"
    given-names: "Ingo"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8294-2541"
repository-code: "https://github.com/dracor-org/scratchdracor"
url: "https://dracor.org"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - DraCor
  - API
  - Scratch
  - TurboWarp
  - education
  - drama corpora
